#: setup/metainfo/dev.nicx.mimick.metainfo.xml:17
msgid ""
"Mimick is a native Linux desktop client for self-hosted Immich servers. It "
"monitors your folders in the background and automatically syncs photos and "
"videos to your server."
msgstr ""

#: setup/metainfo/dev.nicx.mimick.metainfo.xml:20
msgid ""
"Per-folder sync methods: upload only, download only, or full bidirectional "
"sync with optional deletion mirroring."
msgstr ""

#: setup/metainfo/dev.nicx.mimick.metainfo.xml:22
msgid ""
"Built-in Library View for browsing your timeline, managing albums, and "
"searching with Smart Search, OCR, and metadata filters."
msgstr ""

#: setup/metainfo/dev.nicx.mimick.metainfo.xml:24
msgid ""
"SHA-1 deduplication, parallel upload workers, and offline retry queue for "
"reliable transfers."
msgstr ""

#: setup/metainfo/dev.nicx.mimick.metainfo.xml:26
msgid ""
"Environment-aware: automatically pauses on battery or metered connections. "
"Configurable quiet hours and per-folder rules."
msgstr ""

#: setup/metainfo/dev.nicx.mimick.metainfo.xml:28
msgid ""
"Built in Rust with GTK4 and Libadwaita. System tray integration and Flatpak "
"sandbox support."
msgstr ""

#: setup/metainfo/dev.nicx.mimick.metainfo.xml:31
msgid ""
"Mimick is a community-developed client and is not affiliated with or "
"endorsed by the Immich project."
msgstr ""

